  "html_content": "Subject: City Council Meeting\n\n# \u2709\ufe0f City Council Meeting\n*Your quick guide to what's on the City Council Meeting agenda \u2014 September 20, 2025*\n\n## \ud83d\udde3\ufe0f How to Participate\n- **Meeting:** [Saturday, September 20 at 9:00 AM](https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=City%20Council%20Meeting&dates=20250920T160000Z/20250920T180000Z&location=Register%20below%20for%20creek%20locations%3ADublin%20Creek%20from%20Outback%20Steakhouse%20to%20TeslaCreek%20Channel%20at%20Dublin%20Boulevard%20and%20I-680Tassajara%20Creek%20at%20Emerald%20Glen%20Park&details=Opportunity%20to%20influence%20local%20government%20decisions) \ud83d\udcc5\n- **Where:** Register below for creek locations: Dublin Creek from Outback Steakhouse to Tesla Creek Channel at Dublin Boulevard and I-680 Tassajara Creek at Emerald Glen Park\n- **Watch Online:** Not specified.\n- **Call In:** Not specified.\n- **Email Comments:** Not specified. \u2014 **deadline:** Not specified.\n- **Attend & Speak:** Check meeting agenda for public comment rules\n- **Full Agenda:** [View original meeting agenda](https://www.dublin.ca.gov/Calendar.aspx)\n\n## \ud83d\udea8 What's on the Agenda\n### Dublin Creek Cleanup Day\n- **Change:** Not specified.\n- **Impact:** Direct community involvement and environmental improvement\n- **Action:** Participants should wear long pants and sturdy closed-toed shoes\n\n## \u2705 Bottom Line\nFound 15 civic engagement opportunities in Dublin's calendar. Participate in the Dublin Creek Cleanup Day for a chance to contribute to environmental improvement.\n\n\u26a1 *Independent and nonpartisan summary. Facts only; no spin.*",
  "text_content": "Subject: City Council Meeting\n\n# \u2709\ufe0f City Council Meeting\n*Your quick guide to what's on the City Council Meeting agenda \u2014 September 20, 2025*\n\n## \ud83d\udde3\ufe0f How to Participate\n- **Meeting:** [Saturday, September 20 at 9:00 AM](https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&text=City%20Council%20Meeting&dates=20250920T160000Z/20250920T180000Z&location=Register%20below%20for%20creek%20locations%3ADublin%20Creek%20from%20Outback%20Steakhouse%20to%20TeslaCreek%20Channel%20at%20Dublin%20Boulevard%20and%20I-680Tassajara%20Creek%20at%20Emerald%20Glen%20Park&details=Opportunity%20to%20influence%20local%20government%20decisions) \ud83d\udcc5\n- **Where:** Register below for creek locations: Dublin Creek from Outback Steakhouse to Tesla Creek Channel at Dublin Boulevard and I-680 Tassajara Creek at Emerald Glen Park\n- **Watch Online:** Not specified.\n- **Call In:** Not specified.\n- **Email Comments:** Not specified. \u2014 **deadline:** Not specified.\n- **Attend & Speak:** Check meeting agenda for public comment rules\n- **Full Agenda:** [View original meeting agenda](https://www.dublin.ca.gov/Calendar.aspx)\n\n## \ud83d\udea8 What's on the Agenda\n### Dublin Creek Cleanup Day\n- **Change:** Not specified.\n- **Impact:** Direct community involvement and environmental improvement\n- **Action:** Participants should wear long pants and sturdy closed-toed shoes\n\n## \u2705 Bottom Line\nFound 15 civic engagement opportunities in Dublin's calendar. Participate in the Dublin Creek Cleanup Day for a chance to contribute to environmental improvement.\n\n\u26a1 *Independent and nonpartisan summary. Facts only; no spin.*",
